  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of comfort, functionality, and location at Lot 8, 20 Melia Place !\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern lifestyles in mind, this brand-new residence delivers effortless living in one of Stanmore Bay's most desirable pockets.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Flexible Living\r\n\r\nSmart Layout:\r\n\r\nOffering 3 well-proportioned bedrooms plus a separate study, this home adapts to your needs - whether you're working from home, setting up a media room, or creating a peaceful retreat.\r\n\r\nStylish & Practical:\r\n\r\nTwo sleek bathrooms, including a private master ensuite, are finished with quality fittings and contemporary detailing to make everyday living both easy and elegant.\r\n\r\nBalanced Proportions:\r\n\r\nEnjoy open-plan living complemented by a manageable outdoor space - ideal for entertaining without the upkeep.\r\n\r\nSecure & Convenient:\r\nA single internal-access garage ensures safe parking and additional storage, adding practicality to daily life.\r\n\r\nA Location That Connects Lifestyle & Convenience\r\n\r\nCoastal at Heart:\r\nJust a short 5-6 minute drive to the beautiful beaches of Red Beach and Stanmore Bay - morning swims and sunset walks are part of your routine.\r\n\r\nEverything Within Reach:\r\n\r\nOnly 7 minutes to Silverdale Shopping Centre, plus easy access to local cafés, reserves, and public transport options.\r\n\r\nFuture-Focused Investment:\r\n\r\nPositioned approximately 10 minutes from the upcoming Penlink connection, set to significantly reduce travel time to Albany and Auckland CBD. A strategic buy in a rapidly growing coastal community.\r\n\r\nQuality Schooling Nearby:\r\nClose to Wentworth College, Red Beach School, and Stanmore Bay School - making this an excellent choice for families.\r\n\r\nResidents also enjoy access to the exclusive Precise on Melia private clubhouse and sports court, enhancing the sense of community and lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nCall Nikki 0273989137 today for viewing the property.",
